OL,3,AMore than 350 killed in Nepal as rising
OL,4,Alake raises fear of new flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn both sides of the border, hundreds
OL,7,Fof foreigners are missing - Nepal says
OL,8,Fthat includes 178 tourists from India,
OL,9,F65 Americans, and 33 from the UK.
OL,10,FDozens of army and police personnel are
OL,11,Falso missing
OL,13,FMeanwhile, a man in Sussex tells us he
OL,14,Fthinks his wife, mum, uncle and brother
OL,15,Fmay have died in Nepal
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
